{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39158","headline":"洛阳吟 · 韦庄","name":"洛阳吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万户千门夕照边，开元时节旧风烟。\n宫官试马游三市，舞女乘舟上九天。\n胡骑北来空进主，汉皇西去竟昇僊。\n如今父老偏垂泪，不见承平四十年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}